---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ProfileCard from "../components/ProfileCard.astro";
---
<Base title="Aditya Wagh">
  <section class="intro-section">
    <div class="mb-6 md:float-left md:mr-8 md:mb-3 md:mt-2">
      <ProfileCard />
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-pretty">
      <h1 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-balance">Aditya Wagh</h1>

      <p>
        Hi, I'm a research engineer based in London, specialising in AI and robotics. I'm currently a
        <strong>Member of Technical Staff</strong> at <a href="https://neuracore.com">Neuracore</a>, where I do
        robot learning research and turn it into production-ready code for robots.
      </p>

      <p>
        I implement papers and prototypes, optimize models for deployment, and build the data and evaluation
        pipelines that tell us whether a policy actually works. I like making systems faster and simpler,
        especially the machinery that makes robot learning work.
      </p>

      <p>
        I did my master's at <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_University">NYU</a> and my bachelor's at
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BITS_Pilani">BITS Pilani</a>, both in electrical engineering, with a
        focus on machine learning, computer vision, and robotics. Before Neuracore, I worked on machine learning
        based <a href="https://github.com/adityamwagh/SuperSLAM">SLAM</a> at NYU's
        <a href="https://ai4ce.github.io/">AI4CE lab</a> under
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&user=YeG8ZM0AAAAJ">Dr. Chen Feng</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside work I read about public policy, city planning, history, psychology, and philosophy; cook Indian
        food; follow F1, football, and house music; and walk through lively neighbourhoods looking for good
        coffee and great ramen. If any of that overlaps with your world, work or otherwise, I'd love to hear
        from you: find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/adityamwagh">LinkedIn</a>, by
        <a href="mailto:adityamwagh@outlook.com">email</a>, or on
        <a href="https://twitter.com/adityamwagh">X/Twitter</a> (open DMs).
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="clear-both"></div>
  </section>
</Base>
